      },
      {
        "text": "The deaths of undocumented immigrants in the desert are morally significant and deserve public attention.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker’s personal experiences with violence involving undocumented individuals carry evidential weight.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Public discourse on immigration should balance narratives of both border fatalities and domestic crime by non-citizens.",
        "confidence": 0.88
