    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/1/71792.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 14,
    "turn_text": "Well they'll say that alright and I say good because You can't be, you couldn't, you could not function in law enforcement if you didn't profile. And the Democrats on the Judiciary Committee, where I've sat for 16 years, they constantly say that profiling is illegal. And I have to interrupt them and say there's no law against profiling. And if you couldn't say that somebody robbed a bank and they were, what if they're a six, six l-bino Norwegian with blonde hair and blue eyes driving a pinto? with our head sticking out of the",
